<section id="testimonials" class="py-28 bg-cream text-royal border-b border-royal/10">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-16">
    
    <div class="space-y-3 max-w-2xl">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gold">IN THEIR WORDS</span>
      <h2 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-serif font-normal text-royal tracking-tight">The standard clients describe.</h2>
    </div>

    <!-- Dynamic Testimonials Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <% if @testimonials.present? %>
        <% @testimonials.each do |item| %>
          <div class="bg-white p-10 rounded-3xl border border-gold/40 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between space-y-8">
            <p class="text-sm text-royal/90 font-serif italic leading-relaxed">
              "<%= item.quote %>"
            </p>
            <div class="pt-4 border-t border-royal/10">
              <p class="text-xs font-bold text-royal"><%= item.author_title %> &middot; <%= item.company_or_location %></p>
            </div>
          </div>
        <% end %>
      <% else %>
        <!-- Fallback Default Reviews -->
        <div class="bg-white p-10 rounded-3xl border border-gold/40 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between space-y-8">
          <p class="text-sm text-royal/90 font-serif italic leading-relaxed">
            "We needed a team that understood the difference between a tidy room and a space that is safe for residents. They did, and they kept the same people on the rota."
          </p>
          <div class="pt-4 border-t border-royal/10">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold text-royal">Facilities lead &middot; Care setting, Leeds</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-10 rounded-3xl border border-gold/40 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between space-y-8">
          <p class="text-sm text-royal/90 font-serif italic leading-relaxed">
            "The proposal was specific. Frequency, hours, what was included. After they started, the building simply looked as it should, every morning."
          </p>
          <div class="pt-4 border-t border-royal/10">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold text-royal">Practice manager &middot; West Yorkshire</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-10 rounded-3xl border border-gold/40 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between space-y-8">
          <p class="text-sm text-royal/90 font-serif italic leading-relaxed">
            "Communal areas are where residents judge a block. The standard has held, and when something needs reporting they actually tell us."
          </p>
          <div class="pt-4 border-t border-royal/10">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold text-royal">Estates officer &middot; Housing association</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      <% end %>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>